WEBVTT

00:06:30.288 --> 00:06:32.329
Was I what had been done to me?

00:06:32.329 --> 00:06:34.996
Were all of us the results
of things done to us,

00:06:35.038 --> 00:06:36.746
done for us,

00:06:36.788 --> 00:06:39.121
the infidelity of a parent or spouse,

00:06:39.121 --> 00:06:40.621
money inherited?

00:06:41.454 --> 00:06:45.496
Were we instead our bodies,
their inborn endowments and deficits?

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:48.663
It seemed that we could be nothing more
than genes and experience,

00:06:48.663 --> 00:06:51.371
but how to tease out
the one from the other?

00:06:52.371 --> 00:06:54.996
As Yeats put that same universal question,

00:06:54.996 --> 00:06:58.204
"O body swayed to music,
o brightening glance,

00:06:58.246 --> 00:07:02.246
how can we know
the dancer from the dance?"